<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on CEPA.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on CEPA.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it has launched 380 million American-style call warrants on shares of Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA).</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$12.36     PREMIUM	 10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4635    GEARING	 3.33X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  24.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 08.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  2,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$15.45</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
